# Local agent & tooling temp
# Every dot-directory (.claude/, .goals/, .outline/, .icm/, .tokensave/,
# .headroom/, .serena/, .codegraph/, etc.) is agent/tooling-local and never
# tracked. If a dot-dir ever needs to ship (e.g. .github/workflows), add an
# explicit `!.github/` exception below this line.
.*/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

